# Per-user config-engine overrides (tier 3), at any consumer's working dir. The release lock +
# CHANGELOG in .vertekum/ ARE tracked. `**/` so nested consumers (examples/*, packages/*) match too.
**/.vertekum/settings.json

# AI Files and Settings. Root-anchored: the repo's own .claude/ is untracked, but examples
# ship theirs (the agentic example's skill is content, written by `vertekum init`).
CLAUDE.local.md
/.claude/

# CLI e2e fixtures (throwaway copies of examples/default; removed per test)
examples/*/.e2e-*
*.vsix
